  "title": "Blueberry Liquor",
  "description": "Combine blueberries, alcohol, lemon zest, and cloves in a sealed jar and after 4 months in a dark location, it will transform into a delicious blueberry liquor.",
  "authors": [
    "Jackie J"
  ],
